---
// TopBar.astro - Top Bar Pengumuman Resmi
---
<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-bpRed-950 via-bpRed-900 to-slate-900 text-white text-[11px] sm:text-xs py-2 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-bpGold-500 text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-[10px]">RESMI</span>
      <span class="font-medium text-slate-200">Garansi 100% Original BP Group • Terdaftar BPOM RI & Halal MUI</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-4 text-slate-300">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast text-bpGold-400"></i> Kirim ke Seluruh Indonesia</span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-emerald-400"></i> Segel Hologram Asli</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
